sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Customer wallet<br/>(Sangu Pay)
    participant T as TokenisedTaka
    participant R as ParticipantRegistry
    participant S as PaymentSwitch
    participant M as Merchant wallet<br/>(Surma Bank)
    participant A as Acquirer and network

    Note over C: Scans the merchant's Bangla QR
    C->>T: transferAndCall(switch, 2,450.00, pay NAKSHI-01 / INV-000451)
    T->>R: policyOf(customer), policyOf(switch)
    R-->>T: active, within tier limits
    T->>S: onTransferReceived(customer, 2,450.00, instruction)
    S->>S: invoice not yet paid, fee = 1%
    S->>T: transfer 2,425.50
    T-->>M: merchant credited
    S->>T: transfer 17.15 and 7.35
    T-->>A: acquirer and network fees
    S-->>C: MerchantPaymentSettled
    Note over C,A: One transaction: paid, fee split and final together
